{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Hey! Since we last spoke, I've been looking for a doggo to adopt - browsing websites, visiting shelters and asking friends of theirs. It's been both fun and annoying!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-1e1e51760c9100b3ca2921a5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:05.927369+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1e1e51760c9100b3ca2921a5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1e1e51760c9100b3ca2921a5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Sounds like a fun and demanding task! Getting to meet new pups must bring so much happiness. What do you think you can do to make the process smoother?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-647481711b95ea2f7c54246c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:05.950728+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "647481711b95ea2f7c54246c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "647481711b95ea2f7c54246c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Meeting all these adorable pups has been awesome! For those considering getting a pup, the size of living space and the exercise needs of the breed are important. For me, a person living in an apartment, a smaller dog would be best, but if one is active, consider getting one that loves to play and run."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-38e34899546876b32532ebfb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:05.964162+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "38e34899546876b32532ebfb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "38e34899546876b32532ebfb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: That's some good advice! It's important to consider the space and energy needs of a dog."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-ffb5c08c599bd3e1a68c9559", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:05.982476+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ffb5c08c599bd3e1a68c9559", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ffb5c08c599bd3e1a68c9559", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Yeah! Finding a pet-friendly place to live has been tough too. I'm contacting landlords and checking out neighborhoods to find the perfect spot."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-da3b503bcce0a6f0002f870c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:05.997385+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "da3b503bcce0a6f0002f870c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "da3b503bcce0a6f0002f870c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Guessing it's tough to find housing. Any particular part of town you want to live in?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-f6dd177215b2b28085b7f959", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.013272+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f6dd177215b2b28085b7f959", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f6dd177215b2b28085b7f959", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: I'm looking for a place near a park or woods, so I can stay close to nature and give the dog a large open space to run around"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-51cb70e9c435e6ad31f29630", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.029085+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "51cb70e9c435e6ad31f29630", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "51cb70e9c435e6ad31f29630", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: That's a good plan! I'm lucky to have a park near me - it's great for my pup's walks. Last Friday we took a road trip - we went to a beautiful national park and my dogs had a blast! It was an awesome trip!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-f249c19244b17e53d5d3333e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.045269+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f249c19244b17e53d5d3333e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f249c19244b17e53d5d3333e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Nice! Glad the pups had a great road trip. Do you take them on road trips often?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-fdbd51c408961fdfda13c3d0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.061271+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fdbd51c408961fdfda13c3d0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fdbd51c408961fdfda13c3d0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: I take them on road trips once every couple of months. It's a great way for them to explore and stay active."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-0d2203c3f777398f15bea636", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.074186+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0d2203c3f777398f15bea636", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0d2203c3f777398f15bea636", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Wow, that's awesome! I really wish I could go on a road trip with a furry companion."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-1e415a8d75b1f890571902f3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.089475+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1e415a8d75b1f890571902f3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1e415a8d75b1f890571902f3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: It's a cool experience. Having your furry friends on a road trip is an amazing experience. They make it really fun and exciting. It's definitely something to look forward to!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-acb646995f5a9647f18fb295", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.105706+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "acb646995f5a9647f18fb295", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "acb646995f5a9647f18fb295", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Adding that to my bucket list! Can't wait for the day I actually go on a trip with my dog!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-0c848e3fb080cfd7df528b3b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.117680+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0c848e3fb080cfd7df528b3b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0c848e3fb080cfd7df528b3b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Good luck with your search! Fingers crossed you find the perfect one."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-bd9b1600ed78a90dbee4361f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.131198+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bd9b1600ed78a90dbee4361f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bd9b1600ed78a90dbee4361f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Thanks! Your help is much appreciated. I'm still on the lookout for the perfect furry friend."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-b73ed98f9ddef5970350effb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.145205+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b73ed98f9ddef5970350effb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b73ed98f9ddef5970350effb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Not a problem, I'm glad to help! Good luck with your search!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-a42995fb9a14cce243646041", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.158624+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a42995fb9a14cce243646041", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a42995fb9a14cce243646041", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Thanks! I'll let you know how it goes."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-e3b2187bef2dbba287013ac7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.176868+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e3b2187bef2dbba287013ac7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e3b2187bef2dbba287013ac7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Definitely, keep me posted and let me know if you need any suggestions or help."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-c489524a4cca4f706348eebb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.186754+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c489524a4cca4f706348eebb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c489524a4cca4f706348eebb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Will do! Really apprecieate it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-a6de3c8fb1deccaeab1bed3c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.203022+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a6de3c8fb1deccaeab1bed3c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a6de3c8fb1deccaeab1bed3c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Yup! You got it, I'll be expecting a pic of your dog soon! :)"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-21fce56a51cad9ec8ed3a9a0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.217648+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "21fce56a51cad9ec8ed3a9a0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "21fce56a51cad9ec8ed3a9a0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Haha I can't wait. I'll ttyl, gotta check out another shelter soon."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-d9b6cd5600b559fb43e5abcc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.233487+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d9b6cd5600b559fb43e5abcc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d9b6cd5600b559fb43e5abcc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Have fun! Ttyl!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-44/session_5-4bcccdcecc25ad5cfbb2e60a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:06.248314+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4bcccdcecc25ad5cfbb2e60a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4bcccdcecc25ad5cfbb2e60a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
